            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Koegaki 1.12.0</h2>
<ul>
    <li>This release is for the Mac. Windows stays on 1.11.1, which already recognizes custom words.</li>
    <li>Custom words now help Koegaki hear your names and terms, not just spell them. Words on your list are recognized more often, and they still never leave your Mac.</li>
</ul>
